{"blocks":[{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/29/7082800/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"じろり。しゃん！ピシッ！きりっ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"↑春メロのときね"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日はアンダー曲のリハでしたあ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんかね、楽しい曲です"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/29/7082800/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"踊ってたら自然と笑顔に\nなっちゃうよね。\nやっぱりダンスだいすき！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"**********"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/29/7082800/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"握手会行けないけど\n永遠に応援していいですか？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/29/7082800/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"嬉しい><\nありがとうございます。\nいつか会えたらいいなあ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/29/7082800/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ラジオとか聞きますか？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/29/7082800/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あんまり聞かないけど、\n出たいなあ！←"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/29/7082800/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"スケート靴の写真\nどっちがまりっか？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/29/7082800/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"右かと思いきや、左なんです。\n靴下めっちゃかわいいよね！\n欲しい！笑\n趣味合うんだよねー♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/29/7082800/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂の曲は何歌ったのー?"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/29/7082800/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おいシャン♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/29/7082800/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今ハマってるアーティストは？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/29/7082800/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"空想委員会さん、パスピエさん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"***********"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/29/7082800/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひなちまかわいい。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私の顔力んで\nおっさんみたいになってる。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"え？いつもだよって？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"..."},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/29/7082800/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりっか"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/29/7082800/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"では明日も頑張りまりっか"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/29/7082800/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりか"}],"source":"archive"}